<title>FRANCE: EU seen approving Boeing-McDonnell merger - IHT.</title>
<headline>EU seen approving Boeing-McDonnell merger - IHT.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. airline Boeing appeared set on Wednesday to win European approval for its merger with McDonnell Douglas Corp, the International Herald Tribune said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It quoted &quot;people involved in the negotiations&quot; as saying the breakthrough involved Boeing dropping its status as exclusive supplier of aircraft in long-term contracts with three major U.S. airlines.</p>
<p>The European Commission was due to consider the Boeing-McDonnell merger on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
